  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Tools: word application and localisation analysis\nbkTs[n,s] = t_1^z(theta_s) (sparse). bkApplyWord applies a list of {s,+-1} to a bra (t's commute). bkMat[psi,n,S] matricises on sites S; blocks = minimal subsets with Schmidt rank 1 (tol 1e-8). Singleton blocks: fit the site factor f against old.M, M in {G,G^T,G^-1,G^-T} (pure, or 1-kappa M form, f = c(o - kappa o M)).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkTs[n_, s_] := bkTs[n, s] = bkT[n, bkth[[s]]];\nbkTsLU[n_, s_] := bkTsLU[n, s] = LinearSolve[Transpose[bkTs[n, s]]];\nbkApplyWord[psi_, n_, word_List] := Fold[Function[{p, w}, If[w[[2]] == 1, p . bkTs[n, w[[1]]], bkTsLU[n, w[[1]]][p]]], psi, word];\n(* NB: Transpose[t, perm] sends level k to level perm[[k]], so we need the inverse permutation *)\nbkMat[psi_, n_, S_List] := Module[{t = ArrayReshape[psi, ConstantArray[4, n]], rest = Complement[Range[n], S]}, ArrayReshape[Transpose[t, InversePermutation[Join[S, rest]]], {4^Length[S], 4^Length[rest]}]];\nbkSV[psi_, n_, S_] := SingularValueList[bkMat[psi, n, S], Tolerance -> 0];\nbkRank1Q[psi_, n_, S_List] := With[{sv = bkSV[psi, n, S]}, Length[sv] < 2 || sv[[2]] < 10^-8 sv[[1]]];\nbkBlocks[psi_, n_] := Module[{blocks = {}}, Do[Do[If[bkRank1Q[psi, n, S] && ! AnyTrue[blocks, SubsetQ[S, #] &] && ! AnyTrue[blocks, IntersectingQ[S, #] &], AppendTo[blocks, S]], {S, Subsets[Range[n], {k}]}], {k, 1, n - 1}]; If[Union @@ blocks =!= Range[n], blocks = Append[blocks, Complement[Range[n], Union @@ blocks]]]; blocks];\nbkSiteFactor[psi_, n_, s_] := First[SingularValueDecomposition[bkMat[psi, n, {s}], 1]][[All, 1]];\nbkGmats = <|\"G\" -> bkGzN, \"GT\" -> Transpose[bkGzN], \"Ginv\" -> Inverse[bkGzN], \"GinvT\" -> Transpose[Inverse[bkGzN]]|>;\nbkFit[f_, o_] := Module[{res = {}, ff = f/Norm[f], oo = o},\n If[Norm[ff - (ff . oo)/(oo . oo) oo] < 1*^-7 Norm[ff], Return[{\"unchanged\", 0}]];\n Do[Module[{M = bkGmats[name], oM, A, sol, r1, r2},\n  oM = oo . M;\n  r1 = Norm[ff - (ff . oM)/(oM . oM) oM]/Norm[ff]; AppendTo[res, {\"o.\" <> name, r1, 0}];\n  A = Transpose[{oo, -oM}]; sol = LeastSquares[A, ff]; r2 = Norm[A . sol - ff]/Norm[ff]; AppendTo[res, {\"1-kappa o.\" <> name, r2, sol[[2]]/sol[[1]]}]], {name, Keys[bkGmats]}];\n First[SortBy[res, #[[2]] &]]];\nbkAnalyse[psi0_, n_, vecs_List] := Module[{psi = psi0/Norm[psi0], bl, rows},\n bl = bkBlocks[psi, n];\n rows = Table[If[Length[b] == 1, With[{s = b[[1]]}, Join[{ToString[b]}, bkFit[bkSiteFactor[psi, n, s], vecs[[s]]]]], {ToString[b], \"entangled block\", If[Length[b] == n, 1., First[bkSV[psi, n, b]]]}], {b, bl}];\n Prepend[rows, {\"block\", \"identification\", \"resid/kappa\"}]];\nbkVecs[w_, n_] := Table[If[OddQ[s], N[bkVw[w]], N[bkUw[w]]], {s, n}];\nbkVacVec[w_, n_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ bkVecs[w, n]];\nbkVecs[bkW1, 4] // Length",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"126\" data-out-n=\"1216\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"23\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1216]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"NA==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1216]= 4",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
