  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task A: single words t_1^z(theta_s)^(+-1), n=4 (L=2) and n=6 (L=3), on W1 (locus) and W0 (generic)\nFor each word, blocks and identification of each moved single site (resid = relative fit residual; kappa fitted for the 1-kappa M form).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkDir = \"C:/Users/pryan/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/c--Users-pryan-git-projects-abjm-c123/794786d6-48ea-4307-bf67-7108309c1c97/scratchpad/\"; bkOut[name_, txt_] := Export[bkDir <> name <> \".txt\", txt, \"Text\"];\nbkFmt[x_] := ToString[InputForm[N[x, 4]]];\nbkTxt[tab_] := StringRiffle[StringRiffle[ToString /@ #, \" | \"] & /@ tab, \"\\n\"];\nbkScan[n_, w_] := Module[{vac = bkVacVec[w, n], vecs = bkVecs[w, n], rows = {}},\n Do[Module[{psi = bkApplyWord[vac, n, {{s, e}}], an},\n  an = bkAnalyse[psi, n, vecs];\n  AppendTo[rows, {\"t(th\" <> ToString[s] <> \")^\" <> ToString[e], StringRiffle[(#[[1]] <> \": \" <> ToString[#[[2]]] <> \" (\" <> bkFmt[#[[3]]] <> \")\") & /@ Rest[an], \"; \"]}]], {e, {1, -1}}, {s, n}];\n Prepend[rows, {\"word\", \"blocks: identification (resid or entanglement)\"}]];\nbkA = Association[Flatten[Table[{n, nm} -> bkScan[n, If[nm == \"W1\", bkW1, bkW0]], {n, {4, 6}}, {nm, {\"W1\", \"W0\"}}], 1]];\nbkOut[\"A\", StringRiffle[Table[\"n=\" <> ToString[k[[1]]] <> \" \" <> k[[2]] <> \"\\n\" <> bkTxt[bkA[k]], {k, Keys[bkA]}], \"\\n\\n\"]];\nGrid[{{Column[{\"n=4, W1\", Grid[bkA[{4, \"W1\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}], Column[{\"n=4, W0\", Grid[bkA[{4, \"W0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]}, {Column[{\"n=6, W1\", Grid[bkA[{6, \"W1\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}], Column[{\"n=6, W0\", Grid[bkA[{6, \"W0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]}}, Alignment -> Top]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
