  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Tasks B and C setup (6 sites, W1)\nvac = <0_w|; X2 = vac.t(th2); X4 = vac.t(th4); X24 = vac.t(th2)t(th4). Target for B: vac with site 2 vector u -> u(1 - kappa G). For C: sites 2 and 4 both rotated. Solve linear systems.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkV6 = bkVecs[bkW1, 6]; bkVac6 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ bkV6]; bkI4 = IdentityMatrix[4];\nbkRotVec[vecs_, rots_Association] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ Table[If[KeyExistsQ[rots, s], vecs[[s]] . rots[s], vecs[[s]]], {s, Length[vecs]}]];\nbkTgt[kap_, sites_List] := bkRotVec[bkV6, Association[# -> bkI4 - kap bkGzN & /@ sites]];\nbkW[word_] := bkApplyWord[bkVac6, 6, word];\nbkX2 = bkW[{{2, 1}}]; bkX4 = bkW[{{4, 1}}]; bkX6 = bkW[{{6, 1}}]; bkX24 = bkW[{{2, 1}, {4, 1}}];\nbkTgG = bkRotVec[bkV6, <|2 -> bkGzN|>];\nbkLam2 = (bkX2 . bkTgG)/(bkTgG . bkTgG);\nbkRowsB = Table[With[{a = -kap/bkLam2}, {kap, a, Norm[bkVac6 + a bkX2 - bkTgt[kap, {2}]]/Norm[bkTgt[kap, {2}]]}], {kap, {0.3, 0.7, -1.1}}];\nbkShow[\"B_check\", Join[{{\"lambda(n=6)=\", bkLam2, \"\"}, {\"kappa\", \"a(kappa) = -kappa/lambda\", \"rel resid of <0|(1+a t2) - target\"}}, bkRowsB]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
