  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Identification of lambda: conjecture lambda_n = h theta_12 prod_{k=1}^{L-1} theta_{2,2k+1} (theta_{2,2k+2} - h), theta_ij = theta_i - theta_j. Tested on the three theta points (third has theta_26 = h so lambda = 0 exactly).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkLamFormula[n_, th_] := bkhN (th[[1]] - th[[2]]) Product[(th[[2]] - th[[2 k + 1]]) (th[[2]] - th[[2 k + 2]] - bkhN), {k, 1, n/2 - 1}];\nbkRowsL = Flatten[Table[{n, p, bkLamTab[[(Position[{2, 4, 6}, n][[1, 1]] - 1) 3 + p, 3]], bkLamFormula[n, N[bkThPts[[p]]]]}, {n, {2, 4, 6}}, {p, 3}], 1];\nbkShow[\"B_lamformula\", Prepend[Append[#, Abs[#[[3]] - #[[4]]]] & /@ bkRowsL, {\"n\", \"pt\", \"lambda (numerics)\", \"formula\", \"abs diff\"}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
