  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task C: two-pair family on W1\nSolve <0|(1 + a t2 + b t4 + c t2 t4) = <0| rho2(1-kappa G) rho4(1-kappa G) by least squares on the 4096-component bras. Report coefficients, residuals, and a/kappa, b/kappa, c/kappa^2. Also the structure of X4 = <0|t(th4) and X24 on sites {2,4}: contract the other sites with dual vectors, expand the 4x4 (site 2, site 4) tensor in the basis b_i = u G^i.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkRowsC = Table[Module[{A = Transpose[{bkX2, bkX4, bkX24}], rhs = bkTgt[kap, {2, 4}] - bkVac6, sol},\n  sol = LeastSquares[A, rhs]; {kap, sol[[1]], sol[[2]], sol[[3]], Norm[A . sol - rhs]/Norm[rhs], sol[[1]]/kap, sol[[2]]/kap, sol[[3]]/kap^2}], {kap, {0.2, 0.5, 0.8, -0.4}}];\nbkShow[\"C_fit\", Prepend[bkRowsC, {\"kappa\", \"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"rel resid\", \"a/kappa\", \"b/kappa\", \"c/kappa^2\"}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
