  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task D: three-pair (global) rotation on W1\nTarget rho2 rho4 rho6 (1 - kappa G) built from the 8 words t2^e2 t4^e4 t6^e6 (e = 0,1): least squares with the vacuum coefficient fixed to 1, and with it free; singular values of the span; and the eigenbra test of the target under t_1^z.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkSubs = Subsets[{2, 4, 6}];\nbkXs = Association[Table[S -> bkW[Thread[{S, 1}]], {S, bkSubs}]];\nbkSvD = SingularValueList[Transpose[Values[bkXs]], Tolerance -> 0];\nbkRowsD = Table[Module[{tg = bkTgt[kap, {2, 4, 6}], A, sol, rhs, solF, resF, A8},\n  A = Transpose[bkXs[#] & /@ Rest[bkSubs]]; rhs = tg - bkVac6; sol = LeastSquares[A, rhs];\n  A8 = Transpose[Values[bkXs]]; solF = LeastSquares[A8, tg];\n  {kap, Norm[A . sol - rhs]/Norm[rhs], Norm[A8 . solF - tg]/Norm[tg], Max[Abs[solF]]}], {kap, {0.5, -0.4}}];\nbkTg6 = bkTgt[0.5, {2, 4, 6}]; bkEig = Module[{ph = bkTg6 . bkT[6, 0.31]}, {ph . bkTg6/(bkTg6 . bkTg6), Norm[ph - (ph . bkTg6/(bkTg6 . bkTg6)) bkTg6]/Norm[ph]}];\nbkShow[\"D\", Join[{{\"kappa\", \"resid (vac coeff = 1)\", \"resid (all 8 coeffs free)\", \"max |free coeff|\"}}, bkRowsD, {{\"sing. values of the 8 words\", Length[bkSvD], \"\", \"\"}}, {{\"sv list\", ToString[bkFmt /@ bkSvD], \"\", \"\"}}, {{\"eigenbra test: <tg|t(0.31) = mu <tg| ; mu, rel resid\", bkEig[[1]], bkEig[[2]], \"\"}}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
