  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task E: overlap formula with eigenvectors of t_1^z\nFive Arnoldi eigenvectors (largest |tau|) of the right-action t_1^z(u0), u0 = 0.31, at 6 sites. Checks: residual at u0, at u = -0.77, and at u = theta_2, theta_4 (commuting transfer matrices). Then <X|Psi> against P(tau_2, tau_4) <0|Psi> for the B and C bras (kappa = 0.5), and the value of <0|Psi>.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
