  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task C, exact structure of the coefficients\nResult above (3x3 coefficient matrices in basis b_i = u G^i for sites 2, 4): <0|t2 = lambda rho2(G); <0|t4 = alpha (rho4(G) + (h/theta_24) rho2(G)); <0|t2 t4 = gamma rho2(G)rho4(G). Here: generic coefficient extraction at n = 4, 6 for four theta points, then test beta/alpha = h/theta_24, gamma = lambda alpha (theta_24+h)/theta_24, and search a product formula for alpha.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkCoefs[n_, th_, psi_] := Module[{vecs = bkVecs[bkW1, n], F = {2, 4}, oth, T, Phi, du, B3, C},\n  oth = Complement[Range[n], F];\n  T = Transpose[ArrayReshape[psi, ConstantArray[4, n]], InversePermutation[Join[F, oth]]];\n  du = Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ (bkDual /@ vecs[[oth]])];\n  Phi = ArrayReshape[ArrayReshape[T, {16, 4^(n - 2)}] . du, {4, 4}];\n  B3 = Table[vecs[[2]] . MatrixPower[bkGzN, i], {i, 0, 2}];\n  PseudoInverse[Transpose[B3]] . Phi . PseudoInverse[B3]];\nbkConstData[n_, th_] := Module[{vac = bkVacVec[bkW1, n], t2, t4, X2, X4, X24, C2, C4, C24},\n  t2 = bkTrans[n, N[th[[1 ;; n]]], bkGzN, N[th[[2]]]]; t4 = bkTrans[n, N[th[[1 ;; n]]], bkGzN, N[th[[4]]]];\n  X2 = vac . t2; X4 = vac . t4; X24 = X2 . t4;\n  C2 = bkCoefs[n, th, X2]; C4 = bkCoefs[n, th, X4]; C24 = bkCoefs[n, th, X24];\n  <|\"lam\" -> C2[[2, 1]], \"alpha\" -> C4[[1, 2]], \"beta\" -> C4[[2, 1]], \"gamma\" -> C24[[2, 2]], \"offmax\" -> Max[Abs[Flatten[{C2 - SparseArray[{{2, 1} -> C2[[2, 1]]}, {3, 3}], C4 - SparseArray[{{1, 2} -> C4[[1, 2]], {2, 1} -> C4[[2, 1]]}, {3, 3}], C24 - SparseArray[{{2, 2} -> C24[[2, 2]]}, {3, 3}]}]]]|>];\nbkPts4 = {bkthAll, {1/3, -1/4, 5/7, -2/9, 3/11, -5/6}, {-1/5, 2/3, 1/9, 3/4, -7/8, 1/6}, {3/5, 1/7, -2/3, 4/9, -1/8, 5/4}};\nbkCD = Association[Flatten[Table[{n, p} -> bkConstData[n, bkPts4[[p]]], {n, {4, 6}}, {p, 4}], 1]];\nbkRowsCD = Table[With[{d = bkCD[{n, p}], th = bkPts4[[p]]}, {n, p, d[\"lam\"], d[\"alpha\"], d[\"beta\"]/d[\"alpha\"] - bkhN/(th[[2]] - th[[4]]), d[\"gamma\"]/(d[\"lam\"] d[\"alpha\"]) - (th[[2]] - th[[4]] + bkhN)/(th[[2]] - th[[4]]), d[\"offmax\"]}], {n, {4, 6}}, {p, 4}] // Flatten[#, 1] &;\nbkShow[\"C_consts\", Prepend[bkRowsCD, {\"n\", \"pt\", \"lambda\", \"alpha\", \"beta/alpha - h/th24\", \"gamma/(lam alpha) - (th24+h)/th24\", \"max off-pattern coeff\"}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
