  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task F: pairing invariants\nRotated pair (v3,u3) = (site-1 vector, site-2 vector) of each product bra (taken as the identified vectors o, o.M or o - kappa o.M, so the scale is fixed), unrotated pair (v2,u2) = (v_w,u_w). B1 = v3.u2, B2 = v2.u3 (plain dot products). For W1: q = u G_c(z) v; expect B2 = -kappa q = 0.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkFitVec[row_, o_] := Which[row[[1]] == \"unchanged\", o, StringStartsQ[row[[1]], \"1-kappa o.\"], o - row[[3]] (o . bkGmats[StringDrop[row[[1]], 10]]), StringStartsQ[row[[1]], \"o.\"], o . bkGmats[StringDrop[row[[1]], 2]]];\nbkPairF[label_, psi0_, n_, w_] := Module[{psi = psi0/Norm[psi0], vecs = bkVecs[w, n], bl, r1, r2, v3, u3, v2, u2},\n  bl = bkBlocks[psi, n]; v2 = vecs[[1]]; u2 = vecs[[2]];\n  If[MemberQ[bl, {1}] && MemberQ[bl, {2}],\n   r1 = bkFit[bkSiteFactor[psi, n, 1], vecs[[1]]]; r2 = bkFit[bkSiteFactor[psi, n, 2], vecs[[2]]];\n   v3 = bkFitVec[r1, vecs[[1]]]; u3 = bkFitVec[r2, vecs[[2]]];\n   {label, \"site1: \" <> r1[[1]] <> If[Length[r1] > 2, \" kappa=\" <> bkFmt[r1[[3]]], \"\"] <> \" ; site2: \" <> r2[[1]] <> If[Length[r2] > 2, \" kappa=\" <> bkFmt[r2[[3]]], \"\"], v3 . u2, v2 . u3},\n   {label, \"sites 1,2 not both factorised; blocks \" <> ToString[bl], \"n/a\", \"n/a\"}]];\nbkQ = bkUw[bkW1] . bkGzN . bkVw[bkW1]; bkQ0 = bkUw[bkW0] . bkGzN . bkVw[bkW0];\nbkRowsF = Join[\n  Table[bkPairF[\"W1, B bra kappa=\" <> ToString[k], bkVac6 + (-k/bkLam2) bkX2, 6, bkW1], {k, {0.3, 0.7}}],\n  {bkPairF[\"W1, C bra kappa=0.5\", bkVac6 + bkcoefC[[1]] bkX2 + bkcoefC[[2]] bkX4 + bkcoefC[[3]] bkX24, 6, bkW1]},\n  Table[With[{wd = bkWordG[k]}, bkPairF[\"W0, n=6, word_\" <> ToString[k] <> \" = t1^-1 t2 t3^-1...\", bkApplyWord[bkVacVec[bkW0, 6], 6, wd], 6, bkW0]], {k, 1, 3}],\n  Table[With[{wd = bkWordG[k]}, bkPairF[\"W0, n=4, word_\" <> ToString[k], bkApplyWord[bkVacVec[bkW0, 4], 4, wd], 4, bkW0]], {k, 1, 3}]];\nbkShow[\"F\", Join[{{\"state\", \"identification\", \"B1 = v3.u2\", \"B2 = v2.u3\"}}, bkRowsF, {{\"q(W1) = u G v\", bkQ, \"\", \"\"}, {\"q(W0) = u G v\", bkQ0, \"\", \"\"}}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
