  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Search for a product formula for alpha (coefficient of rho_4(G) in <0|t(th4))\nAnsatz: alpha = s h^p (th2-th4)^q prod_{j != 4} (th4 - th_j + e_j h) with e_j in {none,-1,0,1}, p in 0..3, q in {-1,0,1}, s = +-1. Matched at all four theta points (n = 4 and n = 6 separately, rel tol 1e-6). Not a proof; independent validation = a different theta point than those used... here all four are used for matching, so a hit is 'pair-fitted' across 4 points for a ~10^4-element ansatz space.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkSearch[n_, base_] := Module[{js = DeleteCases[Range[n], base], res = {}, th, vals = Table[bkCD[{n, p}][\"alpha\"], {p, 4}], ths = N[bkPts4[[All, 1 ;; n]]]},\n  Do[Do[Do[Do[With[{pred = s bkhN^pw (ths[[All, 2]] - ths[[All, 4]])^q Table[Product[If[o[[i]] === None, 1, ths[[pp, base]] - ths[[pp, js[[i]]]] + o[[i]] bkhN], {i, Length[js]}], {pp, 4}]},\n     If[Max[Abs[pred/vals - 1]] < 10^-6, AppendTo[res, {s, pw, q, o}]]], {o, Tuples[{None, -1, 0, 1}, Length[js]]}], {q, {-1, 0, 1}}], {pw, 0, 3}], {s, {1, -1}}]; res];\nbkSr4 = bkSearch[4, 4]; bkSr6 = bkSearch[6, 4];\nbkShow[\"C_alphasearch\", Join[{{\"n\", \"(s, p, q, e_j for j=1,2,3[,5,6])\"}}, Map[{4, ToString[#]} &, bkSr4], Map[{6, ToString[#]} &, bkSr6], {{\"counts\", ToString[{Length[bkSr4], Length[bkSr6]}]}}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"153\" data-out-n=\"1355\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"33\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1355]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><spa