  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Diagnostics (E, G, interior F site 6)\n(i) normalised overlaps |<0|Psi>|/(|<0|| |Psi|) of the Arnoldi eigenvectors; (ii) Schmidt ratios sv2/sv1 for the W0 end-growing words (is the 'entanglement' tiny?); (iii) structure of <0|t(th6) in the 3-site basis for F sites 2,4,6.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
