  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## High-precision redo for the generic-w words (tasks F and G)\nThe machine-precision inverse words t(theta_s)^-1 lose digits (the Schmidt ratios of the end-growing words came out 1e-8 ... 1e-6, which is conditioning noise or a genuine small admixture: undecidable at machine precision). Here: exact rational operators, converted to 60 digits; inverse applied by double-precision LU plus iterative refinement with the 60-digit operator; Schmidt tolerance 1e-20. The fit also prefers the pure form o.M over 1 - kappa o.M when both fit.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* exact (rational) operators: NB bkId4 above is machine-real, so use exact identity bkIdE everywhere here *)\nbkUnitE[i_, j_] := SparseArray[{{i, j} -> 1}, {4, 4}]; bkIdE = SparseArray[Table[{i, i} -> 1, {i, 4}], {4, 4}];\nbkRhoE[s_, i_, j_] := If[OddQ[s], bkUnitE[i, j], -bkUnitE[j, i]];\nbkSiteOpE[n_, s_, m_] := With[{l = Table[If[k == s, m, bkIdE], {k, n}]}, Fold[KroneckerProduct, First[l], Rest[l]]];\nbkLaxE[n_, s_, th_, u_] := Table[(u - th) If[i == j, 1, 0] bkSiteOpE[n, s, bkIdE] + (1/2) bkSiteOpE[n, s, bkRhoE[s, i, j]], {i, 4}, {j, 4}];\nbkMonoE[n_, u_] := Fold[Function[{M, s}, With[{L = bkLaxE[n, s, bkthAll[[s]], u]}, Table[Sum[M[[i, k]] . L[[k, j]], {k, 4}], {i, 4}, {j, 4}]]], bkLaxE[n, 1, bkthAll[[1]], u], Range[2, n]];\nbkTransE[n_, u_] := Module[{T = bkMonoE[n, u]}, Sum[T[[i, k]]*bkGz[[k, i]], {i, 4}, {k, 4}]];\nbkPrec = 60;\nClearAll[bkTE, bkTHP]; bkTE[n_, s_] := bkTE[n, s] = bkTransE[n, bkthAll[[s]]];\nbkTHP[n_, s_] := bkTHP[n, s] = SetPrecision[bkTE[n, s], bkPrec];\nbkVecsHP[w_, n_] := Table[N[If[OddQ[s], bkVw[w], bkUw[w]], bkPrec], {s, n}];\nbkVacHP[w_, n_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ bkVecsHP[w, n]];\nbkInvHP[psi_, n_, s_] := Module[{x = bkTsLU[n, s][N[psi]], r, sc, it}, x = SetPrecision[x, bkPrec];\n  Do[r = psi - x . bkTHP[n, s]; sc = Norm[r]; If[sc == 0, Break[]]; x = x + sc SetPrecision[bkTsLU[n, s][N[r/sc]], bkPrec], {it, 6}]; x];\nbkApplyWordHP[psi_, n_, word_List] := Fold[Function[{p, w}, If[w[[2]] == 1, p . bkTHP[n, w[[1]]], bkInvHP[p, n, w[[1]]]]], psi, word];\nbkHPchk = Module[{n = 4, psi = bkVacHP[bkW0, 4], x, r}, x = bkInvHP[psi, n, 3]; r = Norm[x . bkTHP[n, 3] - psi]/Norm[psi]; {r, Precision[bkTHP[n, 3]], Norm[Normal[bkTHP[n, 3]] - Normal[bkTs[n, 3]]]/Norm[Normal[bkTs[n, 3]]]}];\nGrid[{{\"inverse-word residual (n=4, t3^-1, W0)\", bkHPchk[[1]]}, {\"precision of t_HP\", bkHPchk[[2]]}, {\"|t_HP - t_machine|/|t|\", bkHPchk[[3]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"161\" data-out-n=\"1428\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"38\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1428]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">inverse-word residual (n=4, t3</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=