  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Exact (rational) check of the end-growing words, n = 4\nThe 60-digit Schmidt values of <0_w0|t(th1)^-1 are ~1e-15, not 1e-50, so either the state is genuinely a product plus a tiny term or something is inexact. Decide with exact rational arithmetic: exact LinearSolve for the inverse, exact MatrixRank for the cuts.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkTE[n_, s_] := bkTE[n, s] = bkTransE[n, bkthAll[[s]]];\nbkVacE[w_, n_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ Table[If[OddQ[s], bkVw[w], bkUw[w]], {s, n}]];\nbkApplyWordE[psi_, n_, word_List] := Fold[Function[{p, w}, If[w[[2]] == 1, p . bkTE[n, w[[1]]], LinearSolve[Transpose[bkTE[n, w[[1]]]], p]]], psi, word];\nbkRankE[psi_, n_, S_] := MatrixRank[bkMat[psi, n, S]];\nbkGmatsE = <|\"G\" -> bkGz, \"GT\" -> Transpose[bkGz], \"Ginv\" -> Inverse[bkGz], \"GinvT\" -> Transpose[Inverse[bkGz]]|>;\nbkBlocksE[psi_, n_] := Module[{blocks = {}}, Do[Do[If[bkRankE[psi, n, S] == 1 && ! AnyTrue[blocks, SubsetQ[S, #] &] && ! AnyTrue[blocks, IntersectingQ[S, #] &], AppendTo[blocks, S]], {S, Subsets[Range[n], {k}]}], {k, 1, n - 1}]; If[Union @@ blocks =!= Range[n], blocks = Append[blocks, Complement[Range[n], Union @@ blocks]]]; blocks];\nbkIdentE[psi_, n_, s_, o_] := Module[{M = bkMat[psi, n, {s}], f, res},\n  f = First[Select[Transpose[M], # =!= ConstantArray[0, 4] &]];\n  If[MatrixRank[{f, o}] == 1, Return[\"unchanged\"]];\n  Do[If[MatrixRank[{f, o . bkGmatsE[name]}] == 1, Return[\"o.\" <> name, Module]], {name, Keys[bkGmatsE]}];\n  Do[If[MatrixRank[{f, o, o . bkGmatsE[name]}] == 2, Return[\"(1-kappa o.\" <> name <> \"), kappa=\" <> ToString[InputForm[Last[LeastSquares[Transpose[{o, -(o . bkGmatsE[name])}], f]]/First[LeastSquares[Transpose[{o, -(o . bkGmatsE[name])}], f]]]], Module]], {name, Keys[bkGmatsE]}];\n  \"none of the candidates\"];\nbkAnE[psi_, n_, w_] := Module[{bl = bkBlocksE[psi, n], vecs = Table[If[OddQ[s], bkVw[w], bkUw[w]], {s, n}]},\n  StringRiffle[Table[If[Length[b] == 1, ToString[b] <> \": \" <> bkIdentE[psi, n, b[[1]], vecs[[b[[1]]]]], ToString[b] <> \": entangled, Schmidt rank \" <> ToString[bkRankE[psi, n, b]]], {b, bl}], \"; \"]];\nbkGanE4 = Table[{4, k, bkAnE[bkApplyWordE[bkVacE[bkW0, 4], 4, bkWordG[k]], 4, bkW0]}, {k, 1, 4}];\nbkShow[\"G_words_E4\", Prepend[bkGanE4, {\"n\", \"k letters\", \"exact blocks / identification\"}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
