   "value": "Search for the coefficient of rho_2(G) in <0|t(th6), relative to the rho_6(G) coefficient: r2 = s h^p prod over (a,b) in {(2,4),(2,6),(4,6)}, e in {-1,0,1} of (th_ab + e h)^k, k in {-1,0,1}, matched at the 4 theta points (rel tol 1e-6).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
