  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The brute-force search for r2 here was malformed (Table with a destructuring iterator) and found nothing; superseded by the closed form tested in the 'Closed forms' section below, r2 = h (th46+h)/(th26 th46), identified by hand from r2 = 0.4578 = (h/th26)(7/43), 43/72 = -th46, 7/72 = -(th46+h). *)\nNull",
