   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Closed forms (pair-fitted at 4 theta points, then checked against the LSQ fits)\nWith theta_ij = theta_i - theta_j, n = 6 sites:\nlambda = h th12 th23 (th24-h) th25 (th26-h); alpha4 = -h th41 th42 th43 th45 (th46-h); alpha6 = -h th61 th62 th63 th64 th65; <0|t4 = alpha4 (rho4 + (h/th24) rho2); <0|t6 = alpha6 (rho6 + (h/th46) rho4 + r2 rho2), r2 = h (th46+h)/(th26 th46); gamma = lambda alpha4 (th24+h)/th24 (<0|t2 t4 = gamma rho2 rho4). Hence a = -kappa (th24-h)/(th24 lambda), b = -kappa/alpha4, c = kappa^2/gamma. Test numerically against the least-squares fits; also test homogeneity of the 3-pair coefficients (word S has coefficient ~ kappa^|S|).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkClosed = Module[{t = bkth, h = bkhN, lam, al4, gam, al6, r2},\n  lam = h (t[[1]] - t[[2]]) (t[[2]] - t[[3]]) (t[[2]] - t[[4]] - h) (t[[2]] - t[[5]]) (t[[2]] - t[[6]] - h);\n  al4 = -h (t[[4]] - t[[1]]) (t[[4]] - t[[2]]) (t[[4]] - t[[3]]) (t[[4]] - t[[5]]) (t[[4]] - t[[6]] - h);\n  al6 = -h Product[t[[6]] - t[[j]], {j, 1, 5}];\n  r2 = h (t[[4]] - t[[6]] + h)/((t[[2]] - t[[6]]) (t[[4]] - t[[6]]));\n  gam = lam al4 (t[[2]] - t[[4]] + h)/(t[[2]] - t[[4]]);\n  <|\"lam\" -> lam, \"al4\" -> al4, \"al6\" -> al6, \"r2\" -> r2, \"gam\" -> gam|>];\nbkRowsCl = {\n  {\"lambda\", bkClosed[\"lam\"], bkLam2},\n  {\"alpha4\", bkClosed[\"al4\"], bkCD[{6, 1}][\"alpha\"]},\n  {\"gamma\", bkClosed[\"gam\"], bkCD[{6, 1}][\"gamma\"]},\n  {\"alpha6\", bkClosed[\"al6\"], bkR6[[1, 1]]},\n  {\"r2 (c2/c6)\", bkClosed[\"r2\"], bkR6[[1, 3]]}};\nbkDiffC = Max[Abs[Table[{-bkRowsC[[i, 1]] (bkth[[2]] - bkth[[4]] - bkhN)/((bkth[[2]] - bkth[[4]]) bkClosed[\"lam\"]) - bkRowsC[[i, 2]], -bkRowsC[[i, 1]]/bkClosed[\"al4\"] - bkRowsC[[i, 3]], bkRowsC[[i, 1]]^2/bkClosed[\"gam\"] - bkRowsC[[i, 4]]}, {i, 4}]]];\nbkcoefD2 = Module[{A = Transpose[bkXs[#] & /@ Rest[bkSubs]], rhs = bkTgt[-0.4, {2, 4, 6}] - bkVac6}, LeastSquares[A, rhs]];\nbkRowsHom = Table[{ToString[Rest[bkSubs][[i]]], bkcoefD[[i]], bkcoefD2[[i]], bkcoefD[[i]]/0.5^Length[Rest[bkSubs][[i]]], bkcoefD2[[i]]/(-0.4)^Length[Rest[bkSubs][[i]]]}, {i, 7}];\nbkShow[\"Closed\", Join[{{\"quantity\", \"closed form\", \"numerics\"}}, bkRowsCl, {{\"max |a,b,c closed form - LSQ| over 4 kappa\", bkDiffC, \"\"}, {\"D: word S\", \"coeff kappa=0.5\", \"coeff kappa=-0.4\"}}, Map[Take[#, 3] &, bkRowsHom], {{\"D: coeff/kappa^|S|\", \"kappa=0.5\", \"kappa=-0.4\"}}, Map[{#[[1]], #[[4]], #[[5]]} &, bkRowsHom]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
