  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task E at n = 4 sites (L = 2) with the full dense spectrum\nAt 6 sites the largest-|tau| right eigenvectors (Arnoldi and Ritz) have |<0|Psi>|/norms ~ 1e-15 .. 1e-18 (orthogonal to <0| to machine precision; the dense 4096 diagonalisation was not attempted). So the overlap formula is tested at n = 4 with all 256 eigenvectors of t_1^z(u0 = 0.31): choose the five with the largest normalised overlap, check they are eigenvectors of t(-0.77), t(th2), t(th4) as well, then test <X|Psi> = P <0|Psi> for B and C (kappa = 0.5).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bkVac4 = bkVacVec[bkW1, 4]; bkV4 = bkVecs[bkW1, 4];\nbkEs4 = Eigensystem[Normal[bkT[4, 0.31]]];\nbkOv4 = Table[Abs[bkVac4 . bkEs4[[2, j]]]/(Norm[bkVac4] Norm[bkEs4[[2, j]]]), {j, 256}];\nbkSel4 = Take[Ordering[bkOv4, -5], -5] // Reverse;\nbkXa2 = bkVac4 . bkTs[4, 2]; bkXa4 = bkVac4 . bkTs[4, 4]; bkXa24 = bkXa2 . bkTs[4, 4];\nbkTg4[kap_, sites_] := bkRotVec[bkV4, Association[# -> bkI4 - kap bkGzN & /@ sites]];\nbkLam4 = (bkXa2 . bkRotVec[bkV4, <|2 -> bkGzN|>])/(bkRotVec[bkV4, <|2 -> bkGzN|>] . bkRotVec[bkV4, <|2 -> bkGzN|>]);\nbkaB4 = -0.5/bkLam4;\nbkcC4 = LeastSquares[Transpose[{bkXa2, bkXa4, bkXa24}], bkTg4[0.5, {2, 4}] - bkVac4];\nbkResidC4 = Norm[Transpose[{bkXa2, bkXa4, bkXa24}] . bkcC4 - (bkTg4[0.5, {2, 4}] - bkVac4)]/Norm[bkTg4[0.5, {2, 4}] - bkVac4];\nbkRowsE4 = Table[Module[{p = bkEs4[[2, j]], t2, t4, ov0, PB, PC},\n  t2 = bkRay[bkTs[4, 2], p]; t4 = bkRay[bkTs[4, 4], p]; ov0 = bkVac4 . p;\n  PB = 1 + bkaB4 t2; PC = 1 + bkcC4[[1]] t2 + bkcC4[[2]] t4 + bkcC4[[3]] t2 t4;\n  {j, bkEs4[[1, j]], bkOv4[[j]], bkResE[Normal[bkT[4, -0.77]], p], bkResE[bkTs[4, 2], p], bkResE[bkTs[4, 4], p], Abs[bkTg4[0.5, {2}] . p - PB ov0]/Abs[bkTg4[0.5, {2}] . p], Abs[bkTg4[0.5, {2, 4}] . p - PC ov0]/Abs[bkTg4[0.5, {2, 4}] . p], t2, t4}], {j, bkSel4}];\nbkShow[\"E_n4\", Join[{{\"n=4: B coefficient a_B, C coefficients (a,b,c), resid of C LSQ\", bkaB4, ToString[bkFmt /@ bkcC4], bkResidC4, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"eig #\", \"tau(u0)\", \"|<0|Psi>|/norms\", \"res u=-0.77\", \"res th2\", \"res th4\", \"rel err B\", \"rel err C\", \"tau(th2)\", \"tau(th4)\"}}, bkRowsE4]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
