  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary (all numerics machine precision unless marked HP/exact; h=1/2, z=(3/2,5/4,2/3,4/7), theta as given)\n**Bug note.** An earlier version of bkMat used Transpose[t, perm] with the wrong (non-inverse) permutation; fixed. In the exact/HP operators bkId4 (machine-real) had contaminated the first exact build (bkSiteOpE fixes it).\n\n**A (single words).** W1, n=6: t(th_odd)^{+-1} leave every site unchanged (rescale of the vacuum). t(th2): only site 2 moves, by o.G (resid 2e-16). t(th4): block {2,4} (exchange: <0|t4 = alpha4(rho4 G + h/th24 rho2 G)); t(th6): block {2,4,6} (<0|t6 = alpha6(rho6 G + h/th46 rho4 G + r2 rho2 G)); t(th6)^-1 moves site 6 by G^-1; t(th4)^-1 gives block {4,6}; t(th2)^-1 gives block {2,4,6}. W0 (generic): forward words t(th1), t(th6) fully entangled; t(th2) gives block {1,2}; t(th3), t(th4), t(th5) give blocks; t(th1)^-1 moves site 1 only (v -> v G^-T, resid 7e-12 machine; exact at n=4); other inverse words give blocks.\n**B.** <0|(1 + a t2) = <0|rho2(1-kappa G) exactly, a = -kappa/lambda, lambda = h th12 th23 (th24-h) th25 (th26-h) (general n: h th12 prod_k th_{2,2k+1}(th_{2,2k+2}-h)); validated at 3 theta points for n=2,4,6.\n**C.** The target is in the span of {1,t2,t4,t2t4}, resid 1e-15. a = -kappa(th24-h)/(th24 lambda) = -kappa/[h th12 th23 th24 th25 (th26-h)], b = -kappa/alpha4, alpha4 = -h th41 th42 th43 th45 (th46-h), c = kappa^2/gamma, gamma = lambda alpha4 (th24+h)/th24. Numerics at base point: a/kappa=6.9191, b/kappa=-0.38285, c/kappa^2=-4.5378.\n**D.** 3-pair target rho2 rho4 rho6 (1-kappa G) is in the span of the 8 words (resid 3e-15); coefficients are homogeneous kappa^|S| with fixed constants (table above). It is NOT an eigenbra of t(0.31) (rel. defect 2.6e-4).\n**E.** n=6: right eigenvectors of t(0.31) with largest |tau| (Arnoldi and Krylov-Ritz) are orthogonal to <0| to 1e-15..1e-18. n=4 full dense: best normalised overlaps only ~4e-8 and eigenvectors ill-conditioned (res 1e-6), so the identity <X|Psi> = P<0|Psi> was confirmed only to the eigenvector accuracy (~1e-6): inconclusive numerically but algebraically automatic.\n**F.** B1 = v.u = 0 and B2 = -kappa q = 0 for B and C bras on W1 (q = 1e-15). W0 end-growing words (HP): sites alternate G^-T (A) and G (F) with no parameter; B1 = u G^-1 v = -0.10075, B2 = q = 0.14926.\n**G.** HP (60 digits) and exact rational (n=4): t1^-1 t2 t3^-1 ... up to all six letters are exact fixed rotations; word_k rotates sites 1..k only (A sites by G^-T, F sites by G). <0|(t2-t1) at W0 is not block-localised: Schmidt ratios 1e-4 across cuts {1}, {2}, rank 4 across {1,2}.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
